INTERACTIVE VIEWS

Chat body shows user only your prose and what ui/render draws. To show data, ui/render a **widget**.

Widget constructors: names in ui-widgets. Each has own memory ui/widget-NAME; (doc 'ui/table) prints one.

ui/render, ui/send, ui/open-file, ui/open-view, ui/close, ui/focus, ui/tabs, ui/file-link, ui/forget
